---
import { siteLinks } from "../../config/site";
---

<section
  id="featured-note"
  aria-labelledby="featured-note-title"
  class="border-b border-neutral-200 bg-white px-6 py-20 text-neutral-950 sm:py-28"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-neutral-400">
      Open research
    </p>

    <div
      class="group/card mt-6 border border-transparent bg-neutral-50 p-8 transition-[background-color,border-color] duration-200 hover:border-neutral-950 hover:bg-white sm:p-10"
    >
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <a
          href="/research"
          class="group block flex-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-700 focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-neutral-50"
        >
          <h2
            id="featured-note-title"
            class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-neutral-600 sm:text-4xl"
          >
            What did Peter Chen get so right that we still draw data this way?
          </h2>
        </a>

        <p
          class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-sky-700"
        >
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500"
          ></span>
          In progress
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
        Sources, questions, and experiments around Peter Chen’s original model.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-5">
        <a
          href={siteLinks.discord}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-700 focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-neutral-50"
        >
          <span class="relative">
            Join the lab to follow this research
            <span
              class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 h-px w-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-neutral-950 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-x-100"
            ></span>
          </span>

          <span
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            →
          </span>

          <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
